flowchart LR
  S0[(S0 Receive accepted HTML plus structured AppSpec)]
  G0{G0 Build-ready gate passed?}
  A1[A1 Create implementation plan from AppSpec]
  U1[/U1 Review and approve plan/]
  A2[A2 Verify available capabilities]
  A3[A3 Map app-owned and library-owned work]
  S1[(S1 Run implementation preflight)]
  S2[(S2 Scaffold workspace)]
  S3[(S3 Define and validate data objects and relationships)]
  S4[(S4 Build integrations and import adapters)]
  S5[(S5 Generate typed client)]
  S6[(S6 Start API)]
  A4[A4 Compose production UI and app policy]
  S7[(S7 Start local preview)]
  S8[(S8 Compare implementation with accepted HTML and AppSpec)]

  S0 --> G0
  G0 -- No --> S0
  G0 -- Yes --> A1 --> U1
  U1 -- Revise --> A1
  U1 -- Approve --> A2 --> A3 --> S1 --> S2 --> S3 --> S4 --> S5 --> S6 --> A4 --> S7 --> S8

